<title>USA: CCC offers 5.54 mln bushels wheat for sale.</title>
<headline>CCC offers 5.54 mln bushels wheat for sale.</headline>
<text>
<p>BULK GRAIN SALES INVITATION NO. 11</p>
<p>				ANNOUNCEMENT KC-S-FSWR-1</p>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corporation (CCC) invites offers to purchase a total of 5,541,216.81 bushels of wheat in accordance with the terms and conditions of Announcement KC-S-FSWR-1.</p>
<p>CCC sales under this Invitation are being made pursuant to Public Law 480, Title I, Title II, Title III, and Food for Progress programme requirements in accordance with a release of Food Security Commodity Reserve stocks by Presidential Order.</p>
<p>Offers and any modification or withdrawal of offers must be received in the Kansas City Commodity Office by 2:30 p.m., CST, (Tuesday), March 18, 1997.</p>
<p>Successful offerors will be notified of acceptance by</p>
<p>telephone by 5:00 p.m., CST, March 19, 1997, subsequently</p>
<p>followed by written confirmation.</p>
